WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.860
=Episode 27=

01:33.910 --> 01:35.390
By wearing that mask this time,

01:36.430 --> 01:38.390
you've terrified the Wutuo forces.

01:39.030 --> 01:40.470
He Rufei will certainly use this

01:40.910 --> 01:42.190
to confirm your identity.

01:44.910 --> 01:46.150
Since I've come to Rundu,

01:46.590 --> 01:47.870
I'm not afraid of him knowing.

01:49.030 --> 01:49.950
When I return,

01:50.870 --> 01:53.630
I'll stand before him
with my head held high.

01:54.670 --> 01:55.750
I'll make sure he learns

01:57.910 --> 02:00.790
who the real General Feihong is.

02:04.110 --> 02:04.950
Speaking of which,

02:06.230 --> 02:07.750
since He Rufei and Xu Jingfu

02:07.910 --> 02:09.190
have been colluding for so long,

02:09.590 --> 02:10.550
there must be evidence

02:10.949 --> 02:12.270
of their collaboration.

02:12.870 --> 02:13.750
And that evidence

02:14.190 --> 02:15.030
is in the capital.

02:15.630 --> 02:16.990
That's why I want to return sooner

02:17.230 --> 02:19.150
to investigate potential leads.

02:20.190 --> 02:21.030
Alright.

02:21.390 --> 02:22.270
I'll go with you.

02:33.310 --> 02:34.150
Young Master.

02:35.070 --> 02:35.910
What happened to you?

02:44.230 --> 02:47.230
I thought you sent Miss He
medicine to restore her energy.

03:06.190 --> 03:07.030
Yingxiang.

03:08.070 --> 03:08.910
Tell me,

03:10.430 --> 03:12.150
why do people yearn for light?

03:13.830 --> 03:14.790
Because of its warmth.

03:16.630 --> 03:17.470
But Young Master,

03:18.430 --> 03:19.870
not everyone needs it.

03:29.829 --> 03:30.670
Aren't you afraid

03:30.870 --> 03:31.710
of fire anymore?

03:35.030 --> 03:36.470
I received warmth.

03:36.910 --> 03:38.270
So the fear vanished.

03:40.750 --> 03:42.230
Is it because of Miss He?

04:02.510 --> 04:04.110
Temporary gains and losses mean little.

04:04.750 --> 04:06.390
I've been maneuvering against Master

04:06.750 --> 04:09.790
for so long to gain power and strength

04:10.990 --> 04:12.390
to protect what I value.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.350
Even so,

04:14.690 --> 04:16.630
you shouldn't have risked your life

04:17.589 --> 04:19.190
and come to such a dangerous place.

04:19.870 --> 04:22.110
You barely dispelled
Chancellor Xu's suspicions.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.670
Then you came here recklessly.

04:24.430 --> 04:26.230
Chancellor Xu may hold it against you.

04:27.230 --> 04:28.310
It is dangerous here,

04:29.630 --> 04:30.790
but an official can't

04:31.350 --> 04:32.590
prioritize personal safety.

04:32.950 --> 04:34.870
I'm obligated to come here.

04:35.950 --> 04:38.070
And my decision proves to be right.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.190
I defended Rundu

04:40.830 --> 04:42.110
and protected its people.

04:42.950 --> 04:44.190
And after this battle,

04:44.630 --> 04:46.230
His Majesty will trust me more.

04:47.190 --> 04:48.270
Also, I came here

04:49.230 --> 04:50.630
to verify something.

04:51.470 --> 04:52.870
What is it?

04:54.390 --> 04:55.230
Yingxiang.

04:55.670 --> 04:56.510
How do you think

04:57.030 --> 04:59.390
General Feihong
before the Mingshui Battle

04:59.750 --> 05:01.230
is different from

05:01.550 --> 05:02.390
the current one?

05:03.870 --> 05:05.510
The former General Feihong

05:05.790 --> 05:07.830
was valiant and strategically brilliant.

05:08.750 --> 05:10.270
The current one,

05:10.790 --> 05:12.790
as seen in the recent Huayuan Battle,

05:13.590 --> 05:14.550
won the battle

05:14.630 --> 05:16.990
by sacrificing seven warriors at once.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.670
This hardly matches

05:18.870 --> 05:19.870
his reputation.

05:21.110 --> 05:22.310
And in the Rundu Battle,

05:22.630 --> 05:24.070
though General Feihong

05:24.230 --> 05:26.230
is said to treat his troops like family,

05:27.030 --> 05:28.830
he completely ignored

05:29.590 --> 05:31.230
Li Kuang's pleas for reinforcement.

05:32.470 --> 05:34.510
This is nothing like what we've heard.

05:35.710 --> 05:36.590
On the contrary,

05:37.510 --> 05:38.350
back in Jiyang,

05:38.950 --> 05:40.070
He Yan reacted weirdly

05:40.150 --> 05:41.390
when she heard that He Rufei

05:41.470 --> 05:42.790
made Chai Anxi withhold

05:43.190 --> 05:44.510
Xiao Zhongwu's plea for help.

05:45.470 --> 05:47.110
And after she heard that seven out of

05:47.190 --> 05:48.510
the Eight Warriors died,

05:49.070 --> 05:50.630
she wielded her whip all night.

05:51.150 --> 05:53.030
Only deep bonds could cause

05:53.470 --> 05:54.390
such a reaction.

05:54.870 --> 05:57.350
She then rushed to Rundu overnight
to help Li Kuang

05:57.630 --> 05:58.790
defend the city.

05:59.590 --> 06:00.430
And Li Kuang

06:00.950 --> 06:03.110
is one of He Rufei's Eight Warriors.

06:03.710 --> 06:05.350
Connecting the dots,

06:05.750 --> 06:07.070
the coincidences pile up.

06:09.830 --> 06:11.270
Are you suggesting

06:12.150 --> 06:14.630
the current General Feihong
is an impostor

06:15.350 --> 06:16.230
and Miss He is...?

06:16.230 --> 06:17.070
That's right.

06:19.230 --> 06:21.150
That's my second reason for coming here.

06:21.750 --> 06:22.630
Only in Rundu

06:22.910 --> 06:24.270
can I unravel these doubts.

06:24.910 --> 06:26.030
And it's proven

06:26.150 --> 06:27.110
that I'm right.

06:27.990 --> 06:28.910
She knows about

06:28.910 --> 06:30.190
the secret tunnel,

06:30.790 --> 06:32.630
masters He Rufei's martial skills.

06:33.190 --> 06:34.350
and even impersonates

06:34.550 --> 06:35.950
General Feihong perfectly.

06:36.470 --> 06:38.670
All these clues point to her,

06:39.630 --> 06:40.470
proving

06:41.870 --> 06:42.710
that she

06:43.150 --> 06:45.430
is the true General Feihong.

06:46.390 --> 06:47.230
Young Master.

06:47.350 --> 06:48.550
You can report this

06:48.710 --> 06:50.510
to Chancellor Xu once we return.

06:51.070 --> 06:52.790
Tell him that you came

06:52.990 --> 06:53.870
to investigate.

06:54.470 --> 06:55.510
In that case,

06:56.550 --> 06:57.790
he won't blame you

06:57.870 --> 06:59.270
for coming here without permission.

07:00.190 --> 07:01.630
From Chai Anxi's account,

07:02.190 --> 07:04.070
Master had contacted
the current He Rufei

07:04.230 --> 07:06.350
even before the Mingshui Battle.

07:08.070 --> 07:10.230
This isn't merely He Rufei's secret.

07:10.550 --> 07:12.150
It's also Master's secret.

07:13.110 --> 07:14.390
Given his trust issue,

07:14.870 --> 07:16.070
I can't tell him that

07:16.670 --> 07:18.110
I've learned his secrets.

07:19.030 --> 07:20.150
So how will you

07:20.790 --> 07:22.510
explain it to Chancellor Xu?

07:22.790 --> 07:24.510
He Rufei has caused so much trouble.

07:24.870 --> 07:25.990
Xiao Jue and He Yan

07:26.110 --> 07:27.350
won't let this go easily.

07:27.710 --> 07:29.190
He Rufei is in deep trouble.

07:29.470 --> 07:30.950
Master lacks capable aides.

07:31.190 --> 07:32.110
He'll need me.

07:32.270 --> 07:34.310
And his past misdeeds

07:34.750 --> 07:35.870
will inevitably surface.

07:36.390 --> 07:37.909
He'll reap what he's sown.

07:39.950 --> 07:40.990
Though a mentor is to be

07:41.430 --> 07:42.350
revered as a father,

07:43.350 --> 07:44.870
when it comes to Wei,

07:45.750 --> 07:46.950
I have my principles.

07:47.790 --> 07:49.150
I can't feign ignorance

07:49.909 --> 07:50.950
of his treason

07:52.190 --> 07:53.950
just because he's my master.

07:56.670 --> 07:57.510
Yingxiang.

07:58.030 --> 07:58.870
Make preparations.

07:59.070 --> 08:00.590
We'll head back tomorrow.

08:01.030 --> 08:01.870
Understood.

08:11.150 --> 08:12.590
Mr. He, Commander Xiao.

08:14.950 --> 08:15.790
Mr. Chu.

08:20.870 --> 08:22.390
I'm heading back today

08:22.670 --> 08:23.870
and came to say goodbye.

08:24.270 --> 08:25.110
Today?

08:27.790 --> 08:28.830
We will return soon.

08:29.390 --> 08:31.350
Won't you join us
to look after each other?

08:33.789 --> 08:34.710
To be honest,

08:35.270 --> 08:36.190
I came here

08:36.429 --> 08:37.630
without Master's permission.

08:38.830 --> 08:40.429
So I must return earlier

08:40.710 --> 08:41.630
to ask for forgiveness.

08:43.990 --> 08:44.830
Mr. Chu.

08:45.270 --> 08:46.110
Take a seat.

08:52.070 --> 08:52.910
Mr. Chu.

08:53.110 --> 08:55.590
About what happened
in Jiyang, Huayuan, and Rundu,

08:55.990 --> 08:57.630
have you suspected

08:58.110 --> 08:59.190
that these battles

08:59.670 --> 09:00.670
weren't coincidental?

09:01.790 --> 09:04.150
These battles were indeed suspicious.

09:04.790 --> 09:05.750
Back in Jiyang,

09:06.270 --> 09:08.910
we found Wutuo spies in the city.

09:09.750 --> 09:11.110
As for Huayuan and Rundu,

09:12.190 --> 09:13.030
Wutuo forces

09:13.630 --> 09:16.550
couldn't have besieged them
so effortlessly without informants.

09:17.150 --> 09:18.150
Rundu especially.

09:18.790 --> 09:19.950
Commander Li mentioned

09:20.470 --> 09:21.790
that the city's defenses

09:22.550 --> 09:24.630
were utterly useless during the siege.

09:25.310 --> 09:26.150
It proves that

09:26.790 --> 09:27.630
the enemies

09:27.630 --> 09:30.070
obtained Rundu's defense layouts
long beforehand.

09:31.670 --> 09:32.510
Mr. Chu.

09:32.950 --> 09:33.790
As smart as you are,

09:34.510 --> 09:36.190
you must have realized

09:36.550 --> 09:37.390
that all the traces

09:37.830 --> 09:39.470
point to one person.

09:40.430 --> 09:41.430
Yet even so,

09:42.150 --> 09:44.990
won't you rein in your path?

09:48.990 --> 09:50.150
Everything points

09:50.510 --> 09:51.710
directly to my master.

09:53.710 --> 09:55.070
But these are speculations.

09:56.030 --> 09:57.590
Even with Chai Anxi's testimony,

09:57.710 --> 09:58.590
there's no proof.

09:59.030 --> 10:00.350
I owe everything to my master.

10:00.550 --> 10:02.550
I can't sever my ties with him
until I find

10:02.790 --> 10:03.630
solid evidence.

10:04.910 --> 10:06.030
Even if there is evidence,

10:07.150 --> 10:07.990
you wouldn't

10:08.270 --> 10:09.910
forsake your master, would you?

10:10.190 --> 10:12.070
After all, you learned the way

10:12.430 --> 10:14.070
of doing things from him.

10:17.710 --> 10:18.710
Please elaborate.

10:19.430 --> 10:20.670
After the Battle of Que City,

10:21.070 --> 10:23.110
all sorts of rumors ran rampant.

10:23.510 --> 10:24.350
Our investigation

10:24.750 --> 10:26.270
suggested it was your doing.

10:27.670 --> 10:28.510
In Yezhou,

10:28.910 --> 10:30.270
Feinu fought a masked woman

10:30.670 --> 10:32.150
while retrieving the tax ledgers.

10:32.750 --> 10:33.630
Her physique

10:34.110 --> 10:35.670
and mannerisms

10:36.870 --> 10:39.590
closely resembled your maid.

10:42.350 --> 10:43.270
Coincidentally,

10:44.230 --> 10:45.630
that same maid was absent

10:46.510 --> 10:47.670
from your side at the time.

10:49.150 --> 10:51.190
Later, Sun Xiangfu was assassinated.

10:52.670 --> 10:53.510
All these events

10:54.750 --> 10:55.590
seem

10:56.750 --> 10:58.270
connected to you.

10:58.870 --> 10:59.710
Commander Xiao,

11:00.470 --> 11:03.150
you yourself used the word "seem".

11:04.230 --> 11:06.670
Baseless claims aren't worth mentioning.

11:08.830 --> 11:09.670
However,

11:09.910 --> 11:11.510
I've found something else

11:12.390 --> 11:13.950
rather intriguing.

11:14.670 --> 11:16.910
While investigating
the assassins who killed Chai Anxi

11:17.630 --> 11:18.550
in Jiyang,

11:19.590 --> 11:21.390
someone secretly helped us,

11:22.190 --> 11:24.150
making the inquiry remarkably smooth,

11:25.190 --> 11:26.990
which saved us a lot of time.

11:28.110 --> 11:30.110
You were the only other person aware

11:30.670 --> 11:32.710
of Chancellor Xu's collusion with Wutuo.

11:34.110 --> 11:35.910
Since the assassins were Wutuo agents,

11:36.870 --> 11:38.710
naturally, we suspected Chancellor Xu.

11:40.590 --> 11:41.910
In Jiyang and Rundu,

11:42.910 --> 11:44.510
you defied Chancellor Xu's orders

11:44.910 --> 11:46.710
and defended against Wutuo forces

11:47.070 --> 11:48.110
with us.

11:49.590 --> 11:50.950
As Chancellor Xu's disciple,

11:51.710 --> 11:53.030
why did you

11:53.630 --> 11:54.630
do that?

11:55.790 --> 11:58.470
You know well, Commander Xiao,

11:58.790 --> 12:00.910
officials often act against their will.

12:01.990 --> 12:04.030
Different stances
dictate different actions.

12:04.510 --> 12:05.670
But everything I've done

12:06.150 --> 12:07.270
follows the natural course.

12:07.710 --> 12:10.830
I will never
cross the ethical boundaries.

12:11.990 --> 12:12.950
I believe that

12:13.750 --> 12:14.710
you have principles.

12:15.790 --> 12:16.950
But above those principles,

12:17.470 --> 12:18.910
right and wrong exist.

12:19.350 --> 12:20.310
I hope you won't

12:20.590 --> 12:22.630
have to face so many helpless situations

12:22.990 --> 12:23.910
or feel powerless.

12:27.750 --> 12:29.990
Thank you
for your kindness and blessings.

12:34.990 --> 12:36.310
I'll take my leave now.

12:36.910 --> 12:37.750
Farewell.

12:48.910 --> 12:50.030
I hope you don't blame me

12:50.470 --> 12:52.390
for not telling you those earlier.

12:53.830 --> 12:54.670
Of course not.

12:56.110 --> 12:56.990
But Commander,

12:57.550 --> 12:59.470
Mr. Chu isn't truly evil.

13:00.150 --> 13:02.950
Perhaps, we could work with him one day.

13:13.590 --> 13:15.950
She's just a masked impostor,

13:16.710 --> 13:19.150
hiding behind others' prestige.

13:20.190 --> 13:22.310
Yet they praise her false heroism

13:22.670 --> 13:24.470
for lifting Rundu's siege.

13:25.030 --> 13:28.270
I am the true General Feihong.

13:29.550 --> 13:31.390
That's me.

13:40.670 --> 13:42.030
My dear sister.

13:43.470 --> 13:46.390
The soul-calming lantern
in Yuhua Temple couldn't suppress you.

13:47.110 --> 13:49.990
The trap in Rundu couldn't kill you.

13:51.910 --> 13:53.510
You are truly

13:53.990 --> 13:56.550
relentless as a lingering ghost.

13:59.950 --> 14:00.950
(General He.)

14:01.910 --> 14:04.430
Mr. Maningbu sent you a message.

14:04.710 --> 14:07.870
Wutuo sincerely seeks cooperation.

14:08.270 --> 14:10.030
We agreed

14:10.230 --> 14:12.830
to help you kill the seven warriors

14:13.590 --> 14:15.790
in exchange for Rundu.

14:16.550 --> 14:17.390
But

14:17.590 --> 14:20.630
where did that fake
General Feihong come from?

14:21.110 --> 14:24.390
And why was General Fengyun in Rundu?

14:24.830 --> 14:25.910
The Rundu battle

14:26.390 --> 14:28.870
cost Wutuo significant forces.

14:29.470 --> 14:30.510
And in Jiyang,

14:30.870 --> 14:32.750
those two people ruined

14:33.030 --> 14:34.670
Wutuo's plan.

14:35.230 --> 14:36.510
Could it be

14:37.430 --> 14:39.510
that Chancellor Xu changed strategies?

14:40.030 --> 14:44.030
Have you reconciled
and colluded with Xiao Jue

14:44.190 --> 14:46.870
to fool Mr. Maningbu

14:46.990 --> 14:48.350
and mock Wutuo?

14:52.350 --> 14:53.190
This time,

14:53.950 --> 14:55.750
I was truly outplayed.

14:58.350 --> 14:59.190
However,

14:59.510 --> 15:01.070
I genuinely wish

15:01.150 --> 15:02.910
to cooperate with Mr. Maningbu.

15:04.270 --> 15:05.830
Please convey

15:05.990 --> 15:10.150
my deepest apologies to Mr. Maningbu.

15:11.110 --> 15:13.830
Since you put it this way,

15:14.110 --> 15:16.310
we naturally believe you.

15:16.670 --> 15:20.430
But Wutuo has suffered huge losses.

15:20.670 --> 15:21.510
General He.

15:21.590 --> 15:22.910
When you meet Chancellor Xu,

15:23.350 --> 15:24.910
please tell him

15:25.470 --> 15:28.310
that Wutuo won't
accept such humiliation.

15:29.030 --> 15:33.630
We expect Chancellor Xu
to provide a reasonable explanation.

15:45.630 --> 15:46.470
Chancellor.

15:46.870 --> 15:49.550
His Majesty has allowed Xiao Jue
to return and report

15:49.950 --> 15:51.150
on the Rundu Battle.

15:51.750 --> 15:53.990
He knew I wanted to kill him in Rundu.

15:54.110 --> 15:55.550
Now he's coming back for revenge.

15:56.190 --> 15:58.070
And the Mingshui Battle, Chancellor.

15:58.590 --> 16:00.350
They will never let this go.

16:00.830 --> 16:01.670
Chancellor.

16:01.950 --> 16:02.950
Please help me.

16:03.910 --> 16:05.190
Were you trying

16:05.950 --> 16:08.110
to kill Xiao Jue in the Rundu battle?

16:12.150 --> 16:13.630
At this point,

16:13.990 --> 16:16.190
are you still hiding the truth?

16:16.990 --> 16:21.990
Who is that masked
young general in Rundu?

16:23.030 --> 16:24.230
Can anyone just

16:24.390 --> 16:27.470
impersonate General Feihong at will?

16:28.510 --> 16:29.430
He Rufei.

16:29.670 --> 16:32.710
How dare you keep me in the dark

16:33.030 --> 16:34.270
about this!

16:35.670 --> 16:36.510
I apologize.

16:37.470 --> 16:38.310
Please forgive me.

16:39.030 --> 16:39.870
Chancellor.

16:39.910 --> 16:42.310
I wasn't sure
whether my sister was alive.

16:42.590 --> 16:44.670
That's why I used
the Rundu Battle as bait.

16:44.670 --> 16:46.990
I planned to kill her in Rundu
even if she was alive.

16:47.390 --> 16:48.310
But I didn't expect

16:48.750 --> 16:50.390
that she would be so hard to kill.

16:50.510 --> 16:51.510
Hard to kill?

16:52.070 --> 16:54.430
Had you disclosed this earlier,

16:54.630 --> 16:57.550
you wouldn't be
kneeling before me in disgrace.

16:59.710 --> 17:00.870
You barely won

17:01.270 --> 17:03.070
the Huayuan Battle,

17:03.190 --> 17:04.630
losing seven top warriors.

17:05.510 --> 17:08.869
Someone disguised
as General Feihong in Rundu

17:09.069 --> 17:11.150
to intimidate the Wutuo Army,

17:11.190 --> 17:12.750
while the real General Feihong

17:12.869 --> 17:14.990
failed to provide timely reinforcement.

17:15.069 --> 17:17.390
His Majesty has heard about all this.

17:19.910 --> 17:22.990
Both Huayuan and Rundu battles

17:23.190 --> 17:25.750
bear a striking resemblance
to Mingshui Battle.

17:25.910 --> 17:28.069
People will inevitably draw connections.

17:28.950 --> 17:32.030
Xiao Jue and your sister
will pursue this relentlessly.

17:32.230 --> 17:35.830
His Majesty will also order
a full investigation.

17:36.150 --> 17:39.190
They might even reopen
the Mingshui Battle investigation.

17:42.470 --> 17:44.590
He Rufei.

17:45.030 --> 17:46.990
Your concealment

17:47.230 --> 17:49.670
has put us both in deep trouble.

17:49.950 --> 17:52.870
The Wutuo people
won't let us off, either.

17:55.390 --> 17:56.230
That's right.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.190
Chancellor.

17:57.790 --> 17:58.710
You're right.

17:59.350 --> 18:00.510
Rest assured, Chancellor.

18:01.110 --> 18:04.030
I will never
keep anything from you again.

18:05.310 --> 18:07.830
Chancellor, please get me out of this.

18:08.230 --> 18:10.590
Chancellor, please save me this time.

18:10.670 --> 18:11.510
Please!

18:11.510 --> 18:12.670
No more secrets ever again.

18:13.870 --> 18:16.750
Good that you've come
to this realization.

18:17.510 --> 18:22.390
Absolute transparency
is the key to our collaboration.

18:23.270 --> 18:24.110
That's enough.

18:24.390 --> 18:25.390
I will find a way

18:25.990 --> 18:27.710
to pacify the Wutuo people.

18:28.470 --> 18:29.510
And I will emphasize

18:30.510 --> 18:31.910
your contributions

18:33.070 --> 18:34.430
to His Majesty,

18:34.670 --> 18:35.630
while shifting blame

18:36.270 --> 18:38.190
onto the enemies.

18:38.750 --> 18:40.910
As for Xiao Jue and your sister,

18:41.390 --> 18:43.030
if my predictions hold,

18:44.030 --> 18:46.070
they're planning to use the scandal

18:46.110 --> 18:47.950
of your family swapping your identities

18:48.310 --> 18:49.270
as leverage.

18:49.950 --> 18:52.310
Now that they had finally
found a chance,

18:52.550 --> 18:54.510
they requested permission to return.

18:54.670 --> 18:57.190
They'll use you to get what they want.

19:01.990 --> 19:02.830
We can't

19:04.070 --> 19:06.030
let them come back alive.

19:07.550 --> 19:08.390
Commander Li.

19:08.790 --> 19:09.750
Open this letter

19:10.150 --> 19:11.350
after we leave.

19:16.070 --> 19:20.110
General Fengyun, Attendant Wu'an,
General Yan. Safe travels.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.430
I'll drink with you

19:21.630 --> 19:22.670
in the capital

19:23.270 --> 19:24.630
after the Mid-Autumn Festival.

19:29.430 --> 19:30.270
Wait.

19:36.110 --> 19:37.710
Attendant Wu'an, a moment please.

19:42.910 --> 19:43.750
Attendant Wu'an.

19:44.070 --> 19:45.030
We will never

19:45.190 --> 19:47.070
forget what you said to us.

19:47.550 --> 19:48.910
We'll do our best to live on.

19:49.830 --> 19:52.110
We've set up a textile workshop,

19:52.510 --> 19:54.030
making a living on our own.

19:55.270 --> 19:57.110
Though we can't fight enemies as you do,

19:57.430 --> 19:59.510
we can make minor contributions.

19:59.790 --> 20:02.550
We'll bring Rundu's
brocade weaving to greater heights

20:02.950 --> 20:03.950
across the entire Wei.

20:05.030 --> 20:06.270
No job is superior or inferior.

20:06.790 --> 20:08.190
Everything improves

20:08.390 --> 20:09.950
through gradual efforts.

20:10.590 --> 20:11.630
Change will come

20:11.870 --> 20:13.070
as long as you take action.

20:13.750 --> 20:14.590
Then I'll wait

20:14.870 --> 20:16.270
to see Rundu's brocade

20:16.430 --> 20:17.470
known throughout Wei.

20:18.230 --> 20:19.070
Alright.

20:19.670 --> 20:21.310
You are indeed popular.

20:21.390 --> 20:23.230
But I don't envy you at all.

20:24.150 --> 20:24.990
I'm leaving, He Yan.

20:25.550 --> 20:27.110
My wife is waiting at home.

20:27.670 --> 20:28.590
Got it.

20:29.150 --> 20:30.430
Only you have a wife, huh?

20:31.510 --> 20:33.190
Attendant Wu'an inspires people

20:33.430 --> 20:35.350
with the resilience he possesses.

20:37.270 --> 20:40.110
Many people may
show consideration for others,

20:40.390 --> 20:41.230
but

20:41.430 --> 20:42.670
those who would

20:43.190 --> 20:44.070
sacrifice themselves

20:45.110 --> 20:47.030
for other people at critical moments

20:47.830 --> 20:49.070
are exceedingly rare.

20:49.790 --> 20:51.030
(He truly resembles)

20:51.030 --> 20:52.190
(General Feihong back then.)

21:05.030 --> 21:05.870
Your Majesty.

21:06.590 --> 21:07.670
During the Rundu Battle,

21:07.910 --> 21:10.590
He Yan led the locals
in unwavering defense,

21:10.790 --> 21:13.230
while Xiao Jue
offered timely reinforcements.

21:13.510 --> 21:14.830
Together, they defended Rundu

21:15.110 --> 21:16.230
against the Wutuo army.

21:16.430 --> 21:17.830
It was a great contribution.

21:18.390 --> 21:20.110
I'm well aware of Xiao Jue's

21:20.430 --> 21:21.350
military prowess.

21:21.910 --> 21:22.910
But He Yan

21:23.350 --> 21:24.750
used to be relatively unknown,

21:25.030 --> 21:27.710
but recently
he's been showing his talent.

21:28.670 --> 21:29.750
He's a real talent.

21:30.470 --> 21:31.310
Your Majesty.

21:31.590 --> 21:32.430
In my humble opinion,

21:32.950 --> 21:33.790
Attendant Wu'an

21:34.190 --> 21:35.310
has the potential

21:35.590 --> 21:36.430
to be a general.

21:36.950 --> 21:37.990
Most remarkably,

21:38.190 --> 21:40.270
his heart beats with patriotic bravery

21:40.430 --> 21:41.910
and unyielding resolve.

21:44.110 --> 21:45.830
On the contrary, He Rufei,

21:46.630 --> 21:48.150
once considered capable,

21:48.710 --> 21:51.110
has proven utterly incompetent.

21:51.710 --> 21:52.590
He lost

21:53.230 --> 21:55.710
seven of our top warriors in Huayuan.

21:57.510 --> 21:58.350
Your Majesty.

21:58.710 --> 21:59.550
The Huayuan Battle

22:00.070 --> 22:01.270
was a costly victory.

22:01.750 --> 22:03.590
But our enemies are well-equipped,

22:03.870 --> 22:05.390
and they far outnumber us.

22:06.070 --> 22:06.910
I believe

22:07.270 --> 22:08.110
that General He

22:09.230 --> 22:10.750
may have done his utmost.

22:12.830 --> 22:13.950
"May have?"

22:20.710 --> 22:21.550
Enough.

22:21.950 --> 22:22.790
Forget about them.

22:23.790 --> 22:24.630
Mr. Chu,

22:25.470 --> 22:27.550
you put yourself at risk
and defended Rundu.

22:28.070 --> 22:29.350
It deserves recognition.

22:29.990 --> 22:31.150
Why didn't you bring it up?

22:31.670 --> 22:33.750
My minor contributions
aren't worth mentioning.

22:37.150 --> 22:39.310
Last time, you asked for rewards.

22:39.710 --> 22:42.110
Why are you declining them now?

22:42.670 --> 22:44.350
Your previous rewards

22:44.550 --> 22:46.710
allowed me to take action in Rundu.

22:47.150 --> 22:49.110
I merely wanted to serve Your Majesty.

22:49.390 --> 22:51.070
Thus, I need no further rewards.

22:52.310 --> 22:54.470
Xiao Jue and Chancellor Xu
don't get along.

22:54.910 --> 22:56.990
As Chancellor Xu's prized disciple,

22:57.590 --> 22:59.230
it's commendable that you're speaking

23:00.110 --> 23:01.270
in favor of Xiao Jue.

23:02.950 --> 23:05.430
Ministers may differ politically,

23:06.110 --> 23:07.950
but we stand united in loyalty

23:08.790 --> 23:10.070
to Your Majesty.

23:13.350 --> 23:14.390
Pass on my decree.

23:15.670 --> 23:17.150
Director Chu Zhao

23:17.990 --> 23:19.030
of the Ministry of War

23:19.470 --> 23:22.630
is a true pillar of Wei,
having shouldered my burdens repeatedly.

23:23.070 --> 23:23.910
I hereby

23:24.390 --> 23:25.710
appoint Chu Zhao

23:26.630 --> 23:28.870
as Fourth-Rank Vice Minister of War.

23:29.150 --> 23:30.110
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:33.750 --> 23:35.990
I humbly thank Your Majesty.

23:49.510 --> 23:52.470
Master, I went to Rundu on my own

23:52.750 --> 23:54.950
against your instructions.
Please forgive me.

24:05.830 --> 24:09.070
His Majesty thinks highly of you
and has given you

24:09.630 --> 24:11.510
another promotion.

24:13.350 --> 24:15.190
You don't need to apologize.

24:19.590 --> 24:20.470
You flatter me.

24:21.030 --> 24:21.870
I'm ashamed.

24:22.310 --> 24:26.230
You've risen in such a short time,

24:26.830 --> 24:31.190
soon to become
His Majesty's right-hand man

24:31.270 --> 24:33.550
and a pillar of Wei.

24:34.910 --> 24:35.910
You are truly

24:36.630 --> 24:38.910
my most accomplished disciple.

24:40.470 --> 24:41.710
I had no choice.

24:42.350 --> 24:43.870
The circumstances forced my hand.

24:49.270 --> 24:50.750
Xiao Jue and He Yan

24:50.830 --> 24:53.350
are about to return for rewards.

24:53.670 --> 24:55.910
Is this what you mean by "no choice"?

24:58.190 --> 24:59.950
They kept distinguishing themselves.

25:00.350 --> 25:01.710
I grew anxious, thinking

25:01.910 --> 25:03.430
that I couldn't just let them be.

25:03.790 --> 25:06.030
So I rushed to Rundu
without seeking permission.

25:11.470 --> 25:12.910
The entire court knows

25:13.310 --> 25:14.390
that I'm your disciple.

25:15.230 --> 25:17.030
His Majesty may have promoted me,

25:17.590 --> 25:18.430
but in reality,

25:19.070 --> 25:20.310
he was honoring you.

25:21.430 --> 25:22.270
Moreover,

25:22.670 --> 25:23.510
the higher I climb,

25:24.230 --> 25:26.310
the more useful I can be to you.

25:32.550 --> 25:35.390
Since you wish to share my burdens,

25:35.830 --> 25:37.470
you should know

25:37.910 --> 25:41.070
my greatest concern at hand

25:41.470 --> 25:43.070
is He Rufei.

25:43.750 --> 25:46.270
You just returned from court.

25:46.710 --> 25:47.910
What is His Majesty

25:48.830 --> 25:50.470
thinking about him?

25:51.070 --> 25:52.550
His Majesty is indeed displeased

25:52.670 --> 25:55.150
with He Rufei's performance at Huayuan.

25:55.470 --> 25:57.430
But I've pleaded his case

25:57.510 --> 25:58.430
by explaining that

25:59.110 --> 26:00.670
our enemies outnumbered us,

26:01.270 --> 26:03.870
and He Rufei may have done his best.

26:07.630 --> 26:09.070
Do you truly believe that?

26:12.990 --> 26:13.830
In my opinion,

26:14.230 --> 26:16.230
it's fishy that the seven warriors

26:16.470 --> 26:17.750
died in an ambush.

26:18.310 --> 26:19.830
But after the Rundu Battle,

26:20.230 --> 26:21.350
I figured it all out.

26:22.150 --> 26:24.910
The Rundu Battle was a trap
He Rufei set for Xiao Jue.

26:25.630 --> 26:26.990
He Rufei needed

26:27.350 --> 26:30.390
huge losses in Huayuan
to avoid reinforcing Rundu.

26:31.030 --> 26:31.990
That's how the trap

26:32.590 --> 26:33.430
would work.

26:34.390 --> 26:35.230
However,

26:35.750 --> 26:37.990
Xiao Jue summoned Yan He

26:38.310 --> 26:39.550
and defended Rundu.

26:40.590 --> 26:41.430
He Rufei

26:41.870 --> 26:43.670
miscalculated and lost.

26:46.390 --> 26:47.230
Alright.

26:47.790 --> 26:48.830
It seems

26:49.390 --> 26:50.910
that you have indeed

26:51.190 --> 26:52.910
exerted great effort.

26:57.030 --> 26:58.230
I heard Zilan came.

26:58.790 --> 26:59.750
I knew he'd be here.

27:01.110 --> 27:02.430
Why haven't you come to see me?

27:03.350 --> 27:04.190
Alright.

27:05.310 --> 27:06.790
My business here concludes.

27:07.830 --> 27:09.510
Pingting keeps mentioning you.

27:10.030 --> 27:10.870
Keep her company.

27:12.190 --> 27:14.710
You must be busy, Master.
Don't let me disrupt you.

27:19.710 --> 27:20.550
Sorry.

27:20.950 --> 27:21.830
I have things

27:21.990 --> 27:22.990
to attend to today.

27:24.110 --> 27:25.510
What about tomorrow?

27:25.670 --> 27:26.750
I have other jobs.

27:27.150 --> 27:27.990
The day after?

27:29.150 --> 27:30.110
And beyond?

27:35.540 --> 27:37.790
(Chu Mansion)

27:38.230 --> 27:40.630
- Is the banquet ready?
- All set.

27:40.630 --> 27:42.550
Don't make any mistakes.

27:42.550 --> 27:43.390
Rest assured.

27:43.390 --> 27:44.350
It's an important day.

27:44.870 --> 27:47.270
- We must please him.
- Mr. Chu.

27:47.270 --> 27:48.270
Rest assured.

27:55.910 --> 27:56.750
Zilan.

27:56.750 --> 27:57.950
You're finally back.

27:58.430 --> 28:00.030
We've been waiting

28:00.190 --> 28:01.670
to welcome you with a feast.

28:02.270 --> 28:03.110
That's right.

28:03.510 --> 28:04.630
Sorry I've kept you waiting.

28:05.230 --> 28:06.310
I went to report

28:06.470 --> 28:07.510
to His Majesty first

28:08.470 --> 28:10.070
and paid respects to my master.

28:10.950 --> 28:11.790
That's why I'm late.

28:12.150 --> 28:12.990
It's alright.

28:13.950 --> 28:14.790
No problem.

28:15.270 --> 28:17.670
His Majesty thinks highly of you.

28:18.150 --> 28:20.470
Official duties take precedence.

28:24.350 --> 28:25.190
Yeah.

28:25.590 --> 28:26.550
Focus on your work.

28:27.110 --> 28:29.510
Leave trivial matters
to your uncle and me.

28:30.190 --> 28:31.270
Let me know

28:31.550 --> 28:32.750
if you need anything.

28:33.190 --> 28:35.710
We'll arrange everything.

28:35.950 --> 28:37.070
Actually, there is

28:37.230 --> 28:38.070
nothing

28:38.070 --> 28:38.910
I need.

28:39.510 --> 28:40.950
But one thing has weighed on me

28:41.790 --> 28:42.710
for years.

28:49.070 --> 28:50.230
What's troubling you?

28:51.070 --> 28:52.070
Tell us.

28:54.310 --> 28:55.750
Don't you want your

28:55.830 --> 28:56.750
scandalous mother,

28:57.190 --> 28:58.470
who gave birth unwed,

28:58.670 --> 29:00.030
to enter the Chu ancestral hall?

29:00.670 --> 29:02.350
Then rise

29:02.630 --> 29:04.030
to prominence quickly.

29:06.830 --> 29:08.070
My deepest wish

29:09.350 --> 29:10.350
is only for my mother

29:11.790 --> 29:13.110
to find eternal peace.

29:24.110 --> 29:25.590
So, you still don't think

29:25.870 --> 29:26.710
my mother...

29:26.710 --> 29:27.550
You got us wrong.

29:27.710 --> 29:28.550
You got us wrong.

29:30.230 --> 29:31.790
My sister was virtuous and dignified.

29:31.950 --> 29:33.790
She deserves to be enshrined

29:33.990 --> 29:35.510
in the ancestral hall.

29:39.190 --> 29:40.030
Zilan,

29:41.390 --> 29:42.630
your mother...

29:45.830 --> 29:47.150
Your aunt was

29:47.550 --> 29:49.470
not good with words.

29:50.110 --> 29:51.590
Please don't take

29:51.790 --> 29:54.030
her gibberish to heart.

29:56.230 --> 29:58.430
I was stupid and often misspoke.

29:58.990 --> 30:00.630
P-Please forgive me.

30:03.470 --> 30:04.310
In that case,

30:05.710 --> 30:06.750
I truly appreciate it.

30:07.430 --> 30:08.270
Our pleasure.

30:08.710 --> 30:09.550
Our pleasure.

30:20.720 --> 30:22.850
(Late Mother, Chu Mingfang)

30:23.430 --> 30:24.270
Mother,

30:25.150 --> 30:26.350
I'm bringing you home.

30:28.270 --> 30:29.390
From now on,

30:30.150 --> 30:31.630
no one will speak ill of you

30:32.830 --> 30:33.670
ever again.

30:39.750 --> 30:42.190
My dear, poor sister.

30:43.030 --> 30:44.830
I've wronged you.

30:44.990 --> 30:45.950
But rest assured.

30:46.190 --> 30:47.070
From now on,

30:47.150 --> 30:48.110
I won't let you

30:48.230 --> 30:49.910
suffer any humiliation again.

30:59.190 --> 31:01.270
You have acknowledged your mistakes.

31:03.750 --> 31:05.150
Mother's spirit must find this

31:06.150 --> 31:07.190
comforting.

31:08.590 --> 31:09.470
All these years,

31:09.910 --> 31:11.150
only I've been coming

31:11.390 --> 31:12.830
to visit my mother.

31:14.870 --> 31:16.670
In fact, she always enjoyed company.

31:17.670 --> 31:19.310
If you don't mind it,

31:20.150 --> 31:21.230
please come more often

31:21.910 --> 31:23.630
and offer my mother some incense.

31:25.190 --> 31:26.070
Should we come often?

31:26.470 --> 31:27.310
Silence.

31:29.990 --> 31:30.830
Absolutely.

31:31.510 --> 31:32.350
Absolutely.

31:33.630 --> 31:34.630
We will.

31:42.990 --> 31:45.790
(Late Mother, Chu Mingfang)
(I'll bring her to meet you.)

31:47.510 --> 31:48.350
(Mother.)

31:48.990 --> 31:50.430
(I have found that light.)

31:51.750 --> 31:53.910
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

31:54.010 --> 31:57.930
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

31:58.110 --> 32:00.050
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

32:00.150 --> 32:05.080
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

32:17.170 --> 32:18.580
♪I've seen the mountains♪

32:18.780 --> 32:20.190
♪And trodden through ice♪

32:20.460 --> 32:23.280
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

32:23.580 --> 32:24.970
♪Destiny is my creed♪

32:25.030 --> 32:26.430
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

32:26.580 --> 32:28.380
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

32:29.580 --> 32:31.050
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

32:31.220 --> 32:32.500
♪Gazing through the mire♪

32:32.680 --> 32:35.070
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

32:35.270 --> 32:37.320
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

32:38.460 --> 32:40.290
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

32:42.250 --> 32:45.160
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

32:45.250 --> 32:47.920
♪There must always be a longing♪

32:48.370 --> 32:53.430
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

32:53.770 --> 32:55.770
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

32:56.090 --> 32:59.730
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

32:59.970 --> 33:01.860
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:01.890 --> 33:05.740
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:06.090 --> 33:08.030
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

33:08.220 --> 33:12.040
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

33:12.300 --> 33:18.050
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

33:18.940 --> 33:24.400
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

33:31.560 --> 33:34.480
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

33:34.570 --> 33:37.230
♪There must always be a longing♪

33:37.680 --> 33:42.750
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

33:43.080 --> 33:45.090
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:45.400 --> 33:49.050
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:49.280 --> 33:51.180
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:51.210 --> 33:55.050
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

